04be83c22\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d192235d-02dc-11ee-a185-df669470ed18\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af548-02de-11ee-a185-a52a9635ada6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0d5ada9d-02dd-11ee-a185-2f1193acdfb6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af549-02de-11ee-a185-45de80584593\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d192235f-02dc-11ee-a185-dbf0472f6e06\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af54a-02de-11ee-a185-4ba6aa61e25f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922361-02dc-11ee-a185-a3af59dc2d01\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af54b-02de-11ee-a185-9bc2e901af9e\">3. 진짜 리얼 기버들에게 주는 또 다른 선물</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922363-02dc-11ee-a185-edcc9adc465e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af54c-02de-11ee-a185-e5ebe92b4385\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922365-02dc-11ee-a185-47bae99aa49b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af54d-02de-11ee-a185-134e87375516\">분기별 모임에서 임원회의(?)를 했다. 주는사란 카페 모임활성화에 대한 이야기를 했는데 역시나 다양한 능력자 분들이 많이 계셔서 할수있는 것들이 너무 많았고 아이디어도 많이 내주셨다.역시 기버카페 :)  </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922367-02dc-11ee-a185-1d457b97d41c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af54e-02de-11ee-a185-35b06f037b00\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922369-02dc-11ee-a185-3def6ba68d12\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af54f-02de-11ee-a185-cfea615643b0\">그래서 많은 분들의 도움을 받아 내 머릿속에 있던것들도 더 구체화됐다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d192236b-02dc-11ee-a185-bd2287d2fa07\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af550-02de-11ee-a185-0f95a81ded46\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d192236d-02dc-11ee-a185-8997b2ce8366\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af551-02de-11ee-a185-53efca5f0b35\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d192236f-02dc-11ee-a185-cf7a5e9a23ab\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2af552-02de-11ee-a185-21c4453ddc42\">- 실제 매출내보는 스파르타반 창설</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922371-02dc-11ee-a185-4bfd588806d6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b63-02de-11ee-a185-f9de88feb262\">- 동아리 오픈 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922373-02dc-11ee-a185-fd49ce338e5d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b64-02de-11ee-a185-bf86e73bdffb\">(유튜브특강들으신분 동아리, 온라인 셀러 동아리, 체험단동아리, 독서모임 ) </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922375-02dc-11ee-a185-8ddf3a5583e1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b65-02de-11ee-a185-93b780c2bbb2\">- 선배특강 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922377-02dc-11ee-a185-2fed2870cb1d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b66-02de-11ee-a185-a13545a8e066\">(카페에는 안썼지만 블로그로 이미 성과낸 분들이 많았다. 그런 분들이 하는 선배 특강을 할 예정 - 이번주 내로 공지)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922379-02dc-11ee-a185-2d4aa5ebd7f3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b67-02de-11ee-a185-cf4f5f58ed10\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d192237b-02dc-11ee-a185-d12dc30c8fee\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b68-02de-11ee-a185-7f87ad51f36c\"><u><b>**특강하고 싶은분도 신청 받습니다. </b></u></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b69-02de-11ee-a185-cf1e6e0e385f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d192237e-02dc-11ee-a185-cfdd91fb9e92\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b6a-02de-11ee-a185-abd0908898d7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922380-02dc-11ee-a185-fd328b0c21a7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b6b-02de-11ee-a185-afda28863eda\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922382-02dc-11ee-a185-512b6ea69171\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b6c-02de-11ee-a185-0990aa3aac02\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0d5ada9f-02dd-11ee-a185-adb057982e22\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b6d-02de-11ee-a185-6b656b3c0852\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0d5adaa1-02dd-11ee-a185-638e27cd322c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b6e-02de-11ee-a185-fb5f776d92dd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922384-02dc-11ee-a185-93e1bbc6199e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b6f-02de-11ee-a185-83f40f8a5f00\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d1922386-02dc-11ee-a185-c1c0192ca3fb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b70-02de-11ee-a185-53dfda734def\">진짜 거의 오늘 아침 10시부터 저녁 6시까지, 8시간 동안 떠들었다. 나도 너무 재밌었고, 다들 시간이 왜 이렇게 빨리가냐고 말씀하셨다 ㅎㅎㅎ 목소리가 다나갔지만 행복했다 ㅋㅋㅋㅋ 끝</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b71-02de-11ee-a185-a1d3e92f1c0a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fd2acdfc-02de-11ee-a185-79b8eca66397\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b72-02de-11ee-a185-4302d104293b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fd2acdfe-02de-11ee-a185-1d990cd17d03\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b73-02de-11ee-a185-49d8c7e171f7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fd2ace00-02de-11ee-a185-a1df8c8182a3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fd2b1b74-02de-11ee-a185-536935bb8b8f\">**근데 지금 또 머릿속에 아이디어가 많아서 넘 피곤한데 잠이 안옴...미치겠다</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
